<title>USA: Sioux Falls cattle no test - USDA.</title>
<headline>Sioux Falls cattle no test - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX FALLS 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said there were not enough any one class of slaughter cattle to test trade.</p>
<p>Steers - load choice clean high dressing Blacks predominantly 3 near 1475 lbs 67.00, these mates to 67.50 steers yesterday.</p>
